WEBVTT

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.120
Is it this time already?

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.750
Why don't we stop here for today?

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.920
We've got the club battle tomorrow.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:27.130
I didn't think I would be fighting you.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.130
I won't hold back.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.130
I don't expect you to. Let's have a fair fight.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.890
I'm looking forward to it, Senpai!

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.830
The finals are over.
Looks like it's finally my turn!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:37.130
Now, all the matches for this
year's rookie battle are over!

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.260
The winner has been decided!

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:44.520
And now, the Hero Interview you've all
been waiting for will be conducted by me,

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.060
representative of the manga
research club, Shigure Ninomiya!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.350
Ninomiya!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.270
He took off his glasses today!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.940
Such a rare treat!

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:58.780
The winner, Otone Fujishiro,
is actually not part of any club!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:04.660
If she's still not part of a club, then her
circumstances are the same as yours, Eruna.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.120
But, I wonder why

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.920
she doesn't look happy at all
even though she won.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:13.500
And so, let's have the Hero Interview!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.140
Hero Interview?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:23.470
It wasn't much more than a warm-up for me.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.020
I don't really have anything to say!

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:39.700
W-Wait a minute!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.490
The Hero Interview isn't over yet!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.490
Sorry about that. Now...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.450
Shigure...

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:50.750
He's that blind without his glasses, ryui?

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.380
Now, let's try this again.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.090
Let's continue the Hero Interview!

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.880
First, tell us how you feel right now.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:04.220
I feel conflicted...
It's hard to explain in one word...

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.600
Eh? Huh?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.390
Sorry! I interviewed the wrong person!

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.400
Um, where's Fujishiro?

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.400
This is the first time I've seen
someone in real life show their frustration

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.740
by biting on a handkerchief!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.200
Eruna! There you are!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.330
How did he know? He can't see!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.540
He sniffed you out, ryui.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.340
W-Wai... Shigure?!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:39.970
Now, since we've got some extra time,
here's a special interview!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:44.800
She left a great impression at this year's
rookie battle, making it to the quarterfinals,

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:49.810
and also plans to leave behind
adorable children with me in the future—

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.560
My dear cousin, Eruna Ichino—

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.200
I wonder what kind of girl Otone is?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.240
I'd like to meet her and talk to her.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:05.820
What would you do after talking to her, ryui?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:10.250
Nothing in particular.
I'm just curious about her attitude earlier.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:17.460
I believe Minatogawa takes care of
most of the flowerbeds over there, ryui.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.090
There she is!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.220
What is with that adorable
girlish sitting position?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:32.770
Anyone could go on and on talking about
the charm and magic of that girlish pose!

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.600
I will go and talk about it now!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:35.900
Wait, ryui!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:39.190
It sounds like she's muttering
something to herself, ryui.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.230
I did it again...

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:45.780
It's fine, Otone! You can sit in that position
anytime, anywhere, as much as you want!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.120
Stop thinking about that, ryui.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.540
Even though I didn't think that...

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:56.290
Even so... the devil that lives in Fujishiro's...
Fujishiro's head...

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.250
Why did her pronunciation of
"devil" sound so sophisticated?

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:03.670
Did she live abroad?
She also referred to herself by last name!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:04.720
It's too good!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.640
How can I fix this shyness?

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.970
When I get nervous, my mind goes blank,

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.060
and mean words come out
of my mouth on their own!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.390
I don't want that to happen anymore!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:20.190
Otone, you don't have to worry about anything!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.150
I will hold you tight!

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.360
I'll protect you...

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:28.110
It's a demon! Like what Mama said
time and time again to be careful of!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:31.200
A beast that comes after cute girls!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.000
Fujishiro grew up cute,
so one has finally appeared, huh?

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:39.330
Mama, did you see that? Fujishiro did it!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.420
It's not just the part
where she doesn't belong to a club—

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:44.840
She's also a strange girl, just like you, ryui.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.130
Huh?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.800
I thought I'd seen you before somewhere...

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:55.930
Aren't you the person who won halfway
and then lost in a half-hearted way?

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.890
My name's Eruna Ichinomiya!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.020
I'll stay right by your side
until you stop being shy!

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:07.200
I'm not shy! I don't even
understand what that means!

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.490
She's applying her "lived abroad character"
at a weird time, ryui.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:14.410
Oh, Mr. Bimii! Thank you for your hard work!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.910
Otone Fujishiro is a star student today, too!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:21.460
A star student! "Otone Fujishiro
is a super star student"...

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:25.460
Mr. Bimii should write that
in my student record... Write that...

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.470
- Write that...
- Will you please stop trying to brainwash me

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:29.880
- Write that...
- by whispering that over and over in my ear?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.600
I don't think Bimii has the power
to write in any student records.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:35.640
What? Is that right?

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.060
So even though you're a teacher,
you're low on the totem pole?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.100
You're in a weird position?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.070
Why are you so beaming ugly?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.030
Can I kick you?

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:49.070
Her attitude changed all of a sudden, ryui...

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.570
Black Otone, or White Otone? I can't choose!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.410
I love both of them!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.620
Will you please stop being rude?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.830
Fujishiro is always pure white!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.170
Neener!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:07.550
Shameless! That girl is more shameless
and air-headed than necessary!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.550
And so, Seisa—

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.970
Please try the girlish sitting position!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.350
Like this...?

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.480
Th-This is it, the super orthodox style!

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:23.440
It's the perfect girlish pose, with no
openings no matter what angle you look from!

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:25.690
You're amazing, Seisa!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:32.910
That might be the orthodox style,
but the girlish pose evokes unexpected beauty

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:38.450
when that perfection is interrupted
by occasional openings.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.500
And here we get the unexpected
girlish pose from Miss Kurumi!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:48.130
On top of that is a waft of a slightly dangerous
fragrance, skirting the edges of foul play!

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:53.340
The collaboration with Seisa's orthodox
style also brings an exquisite sy-ner-gy!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:09:00.600
You can imagine whatever you want, but will
you please not drag me into your delusions?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.190
Yes, ma'am...

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:08.190
So, the winner was Otone Fujishiro, that girl
with the wonderful girlish sitting position?

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:15.410
Yes! Like me, she doesn't belong to a club,
but uh, unlike me, she seems a bit strange...

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.830
I heard Imizu lost terribly?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:24.330
Yes, but in his interview
after Otone left, Asuhi said:

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:30.170
The winner, Otone Fujishiro, was very strong,
and I don't even compare to her right now.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:35.930
But after this, I think I will fight
Fujishiro again at the next club battle.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:40.010
I want to fight her time and time again
and have more wins than losses in the end.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:43.520
I will definitely show you I can win!

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:45.900
That's why I also thought—

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.980
I'm going to work hard to create my new club,

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.860
and next time, I don't want
to stop in the quarterfinals.

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.820
I'm going to win and stand on that stage!

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:58.370
Seisa, what kind of new club
do you think I should make?

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:05.080
Wasn't it the "Surrounding Eruna
Ichinomiya with Cute Girls Club"?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:12.210
What about the "Kicking Eruna
Ichinomiya with Cute Girls Club"?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.380
Oh, I didn't think of that!
But it's a possibility!

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.430
It is?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:20.050
Why don't you just call it the
"Eejit Club" and leave it at that?

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.720
Well, no matter what club it is,

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:27.150
the problem is gathering the
three people needed to form a club.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.610
But once I form the club, Seisa,

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:34.070
please fight me again as
representative of the going-home club!

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.030
I won't hold back.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.990
I don't expect you to! Let's have a fair fight.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.280
I'm looking forward to it, Senpai!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.460
Is something the matter?

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.420
No, it's nothing.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.110
Oh, it's Asuhi!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.070
Congrats on winning second place!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.780
Oh, the members of the drama club...

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.330
Is something the matter?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:28.670
Early predictions pegged Asuhi Imizu
as a first-magnitude star,

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:31.500
but he was actually a sixth-magnitude
star and didn't shine at all...

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.420
That's so mean!
They shouldn't have written that!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:38.010
It was because I wasn't strong enough

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.840
and didn't live up to
everyone's expectations,

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.220
so it can't be helped.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.260
I watched the match,

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:49.520
and I think you were definitely stronger than
when you had that practice match with Yuto.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.110
You shouldn't worry about it too much, rowr!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.610
I won't. Thank you.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:55.820
It's just...

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:01.660
Even a dim star is sending light somewhere.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:07.040
But that faint light was ridiculed,
and I regret that...

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.540
It makes me sad...

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.050
A gathering to cheer Asuhi up?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.220
Yeah, Akama suggested it.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:23.850
H-He seems like he's still
kind of down, you know?

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.810
So I just wanted to know what you all thought...

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.600
Why not? Let's do it!

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:32.020
If we do it, it should be less serious
than a "cheering up gathering," ryui.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.940
Yeah, we should make it like a party!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.900
If we're having a party,
it should be a surprise, rowr!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.690
Oh, nice! A surprise!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.450
Then let's have the party in Yuto's room!

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.280
Wait, why <i>my</i> room?!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.120
And who should we invite?

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:49.910
Himi, Katai, and Minatogawa will come, right?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.380
I wonder if Seisa and Enoyan
will come this time?

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.210
Oh, let's invite Otone, too!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.760
What?! Fujishiro, too?!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.170
She's the opponent Asuhi lost to, rowr!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.010
Would it be okay to invite her?

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:07.390
Of course! I don't know if she'll come,
but White Otone would be fine!

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.270
And then, let's see...

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.390
You called, Eruna?

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:11.230
No, I didn't!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:12.230
What?!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:16.810
Well, since we've decided to do it,
the drama club will plan it.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.860
Ichinomiya, will you invite everyone?

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:20.690
Roger!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:21.740
Let's go, Bimii!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.610
Ryui...!

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.580
A party? I'll be there! What should I wear?

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.500
Himi, you'd look good in anything!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.460
But if I had to choose something,
I'd say come in your birthday suit!

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:38.250
Okay! Then, I'll cover myself in blood
and attach an umbilical cord, okay?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.130
Was that what you meant, ryui?

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.420
I think that'd work, too!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.050
No, ryui! That would
totally put Asuhi off, ryui!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:47.760
I'll go if you want,
but I won't give this to you!

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.100
I don't want that.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.430
If I go, I might ruin the mood, you know.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:56.270
But I guess it's okay
if it's ruined just a little...

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.520
If it's ruined, Bimii will fix it!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.780
I... will fix it... ryui...?

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:08.450
Why does Fujishiro have to go to that party?

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.620
I don't get it.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.790
Come on, please, White Otone?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:13.750
I don't want to.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.290
Aw, don't say that. C'mon!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:20.000
A party? Okay, I'll think about it.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.000
I look forward to your wonderful reply!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.550
T... Too heavy, ryui...

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:27.300
Well, what kind of party should we have?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.930
A normal party is boring!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:33.770
What about a party under the stars
that Imizu likes so much?

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.730
The roof at night, rowr!

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.150
Oh, that's a good idea!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:42.190
Then let's change the location
of the party from my room to the roof.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.320
What should we tell Asuhi?

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:47.280
Of course, it's a surprise,

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:50.240
so we should give him this invitation
without telling him what it's for.

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.410
I'm exhausted, ryui...

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.960
Oh, Mr. Bimii! Perfect timing, rowr!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:14:59.380
Did you invite everyone?

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:03.840
I also followed Eruna around as she bought food,

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.800
but it looks like everyone will come, ryui.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:08.130
Thanks, Mr. Bimii!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:13.260
Then, tell Eruna that the
location has changed to the roof.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.640
Also, can you give this letter to Asuhi?

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:18.850
Ryui...?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:26.690
Jeez, everyone's working me so hard, ryui...

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:30.070
Oh, Mr. Bimii. Hello!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.870
Asuhi... I was looking for you, ryui.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:37.200
I have a message from the drama club.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:41.210
The location has changed
to the roof of the dorm, ryui.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.420
Huh?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:45.500
Well, see you later, ryui...

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:58.060
She's not back yet, ryui?

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.640
It can't be helped, ryui.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:04.770
Huh?

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:09.950
What's this?

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.530
Could this be a challenge letter?

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:16.910
Did someone who wanted to challenge a
rookie battle quarterfinalist send this to me?

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:21.580
If I accept this challenge and win in a
cool way, it'll be the talk of the school!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.920
Then, it will also help promote my new club!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.590
All right...!

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.760
Eruna's not here yet...

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.930
Seisa isn't, either, huh?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.640
Fujishiro isn't coming after all either, huh?

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:42.230
You think Asuhi will end up
getting here before them?

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:44.400
We should probably all hide soon...

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:48.150
Jeez, just how much do you guys like surprises?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:10.340
Is he here?

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:15.850
Eruna?

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.310
Huh? Did I come too early?

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:24.100
Should I have come late on purpose and made
a cool entrance with "Thanks for waiting!"?

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:27.060
Is Eruna confused about something?

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.490
Ichinomiya...

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.610
Minatogawa!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.370
You were the one who challenged
me to a match, Minatogawa?

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.160
Very well. I accept your challenge!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:45.540
Oh. Um. Then, I will, too...

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.040
What?

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.250
Huh?!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.010
Excuse me...?

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.180
Wait, Asuhi?!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:06.600
I heard that the location had changed,
but what was it the location of?

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.360
Oh, dear...

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.360
The surprise failed, huh?

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:12.230
It can't be helped. Let's go.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.070
Jump!

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:15.990
And land.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:21.830
And now, we'll start the party with me,
Shigure Ninomiya, as the MC!

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.120
What?!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.170
Asuhi!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:31.050
Congrats on second place in the rookie battle!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.130
Huh? What?

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:39.390
That's right! The star of the
party today is you, Asuhi Imizu—!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.280
Is that what happened?

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:01.370
You planned a party for me? Thank you!

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:03.410
You don't have to be so formal.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.370
That's right!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.870
No need to fuss, rowr!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:09.630
Jeez, it's Bimii's fault
for making a weird mistake!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:13.420
No, even if he didn't
make a mistake, rain is rain.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.380
We were defeated because we
didn't check the weather forecast.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.340
Shall we go somewhere else?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.430
The drama club room has a lot of space, right?

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:23.100
What? You don't want to wait a little longer?

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:25.100
The rain might stop, rowr!

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:28.140
Since we have this chance,
I wanna have the party under the stars!

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:31.860
Yeah, 'cause it's a party for Asuhi!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.530
I really appreciate it.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:42.280
Did I ever tell you all the
reason I came to love stars?

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.830
No, what was it?

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:49.580
I was bullied ever since I was little.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:54.800
Because I wasn't manly enough,
or because of something equally silly.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:55.960
At that time,

00:19:56.170 --> 00:20:01.640
I heard that if you make a wish three times on a
falling star, your wish would come true.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:04.970
So then one day, I made a wish.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.470
I wished that I could become strong.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:10.810
That I wouldn't lose.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.480
I might've just convinced myself of it,

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:19.200
but because of that, I was able to
stand up to my bullies for the first time.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:22.700
Then, they stopped bullying me.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.830
That's when you came to love stars?

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.950
Yes, that's right.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:32.120
He wasn't just smiling, huh...

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.170
He wasn't perfect...

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:34.960
Hm?

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:38.300
Oh, it's nothing.

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:39.510
Huh?

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:54.100
Killing Art.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.920
Wow, it's so pretty!

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:37.770
That's Arcturus. It's a star near Spica
that's called the star of happiness!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:39.400
Really?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:40.780
You know, Asuhi...

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:48.120
You don't realize it yourself,
but you always shine brightly like that.

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:50.830
At least, that's how I see it.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.410
I see.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.000
Fujishiro saw you.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.470
This is the power of your Killing Art,
right, Seisa?

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:45.030
What would <i>you</i> wish for
on a falling star, Eruna?

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:46.490
It's okay if I say it?

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:47.530
Of course.

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:50.160
Really? Don't look at me if things get crazy.

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:52.700
Because I'll say it. Three times, even!

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:57.960
It's 13 years in the making,
a long list crammed into 158 notebooks!

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:00.830
The sun would come up
before you say that three times.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.960
And it's Asuhi with the retort!

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:04.960
Nice! Awesome!

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:06.550
You're good as the funny man,

00:24:06.760 --> 00:24:08.010
but you're also great as the straight man!

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:09.930
Thank you...?

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.430
What would you wish for, Fujishiro?

00:24:12.640 --> 00:24:18.060
Fujishiro would only wish for one thing:
world conquest, of course.

00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:20.390
Why just earlier,
I was working out a dreadful plan

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:22.440
with the big four who serve me.

00:24:22.650 --> 00:24:23.940
Oh, the big four!

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:27.320
You mean those guys who
did the super-funny impressions!

00:24:27.530 --> 00:24:29.530
Oh, I like that big four too!

00:24:29.740 --> 00:24:33.660
No, not that big four!
They're a much more dreadful big four!

00:24:33.870 --> 00:24:36.370
They're so dreadful,
they'll make you wet yourself!

00:24:36.580 --> 00:24:38.290
Next time, "Unidentified Treasure."

00:24:38.500 --> 00:24:42.080
I'll defeat the dreadful big four,
and this time <i>I'll</i> be #1!

00:24:42.290 --> 00:24:43.130
The big four show up?!

00:24:43.330 --> 00:24:45.210
Uh, no. They don't...
